          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka oloki maŋon gi cal ma cwec ma jobwombi gin, cal ma yath thith, kodi cal ma mawuwin, m'oyido oum gi zahabu kwoŋe je.",
          "type": "text",
