            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogeti diedipo ma iye ruwaŋ Ot pa Were, m'othok gi kor ot m'oyido nitie gi mbawo acel ma yath sida kwoŋ kisi telin m'okonji didek.",
          "type": "text",
