          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I dwe mar'aboro, dwe ma Buli, i oro mar'apar g'acel ma dhum pa Solomon, Ot pa Were oyido otiek geto paka oyido ocan. Otero Solomon oro abirio geto.",
          "type": "text",
